# AUT-1736 — accepted trivy findings for the pgvector/pgvector base image.
#
# The pinned pgvector/pgvector:pg16 image ships a Go binary built against
# Go stdlib 1.24.6. Its CVEs below are all Denial-of-Service in net/http,
# crypto/tls, mime, net/mail, encoding/xml, net/url and html/template. They
# are NOT in the PostgreSQL server code path and are outside AutoBrain's
# control (fix requires an upstream pgvector rebuild on a patched Go
# toolchain). They are documented here so the CI gate can still FAIL on any
# genuinely new CRITICAL/HIGH finding (e.g. the perl/SQLite/zlib/libxml2/
# OpenSSL RCE/overflow classes this issue remediated).
#
# Re-scan before removing any entry: `trivy image pgvector/pgvector:pg16@<digest>`
